          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Nk'okuguubwa kubi kwangye n'ekiniga kyangye oku byashukirwe aha batuuzi ba Yerusaalemu, nikwo naimwe murishukwaho ekiniga kyangye mwahika Misri. Kandi muryaba ekirikwamaganwa, ekirikutiinisa, eky'okukyeenwa n'eky'okushekyererwa; kandi timurigaruka kureeba ogu mwanya bundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.2.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 2:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Imwe abatsigaire omuri Yuda, MUKAMA abagizire ati: Mutaza Misri. Mukimanyire kimwe ku naabeehanangiriza eri izooba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ku mutashemereire kuhaba mukafa, ahabw'okuba mukantuma ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, nimugira muti: Tushabire ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu; kandi kyona eki MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu araagambe, okutugambire, naitwe nitwija kukikora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu eri izooba naakibagambira, kwonka timwayorobera iraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu omuri byona ebi abantumireho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 42:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo mumanyire kimwe, ku rurara n'enjara n'orufu birikwija kubaitira, ei murikwenda kuza kutuura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.42.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.42.22"
            ]
          }
        }
